---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到" noindex>
  <section class="not-found shell narrow">
    <p class="kicker">404 · LOST IN ORBIT</p>
    <h1>这颗星暂时不在这里。</h1>
    <p>链接可能已经失效，或者它还只是一篇没有公开的草稿。</p>
    <a class="button primary" href="/">返回首页 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
